                <p>No. 2 Raw cow-hides incl. hides of horse and calf.</p>
                <p>No. 20 80,000,000 respectively 56.000,000 kilos to be distilled, the rest for
                    heating purposes for the electric station of the city of Vienna and different
                    factories.</p>
                <p>No. 33 Cotton yarn could be manufactured at home except a small amount of certain
                    numbers and qualities.</p>
                <p>No. 36 The only linen-mill working by water-power.</p>
                <p>No. 38 If mill at Lajta-ujfalu (Western Hungary) [is?] to be considered, need
                    amounts to 17,500,000 respectively 13,000,000 kilos [<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >17,500,000 and 18,000,000 kilos respectively?</hi>]</p>
                <p>No. 47 For making underlinen.</p>
